-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":-279,"link_td_description":"孟尝君，妫姓，田氏，名文，字孟，战国四公子之一，齐国的公族。其父靖郭君田婴死后，田文继位薛公于薛城（今山东滕州东南），号孟尝君，以广招宾客、食客三千闻名。","link_td_id":"Q10001044","link_td_number_id":205703,"people_name":"文","people_name_jianti_auto":"文","people_xingming":"田文","start_index":227,"tongjian_id":"8c47748f-db0e-11ef-9fce-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"楚","place_name_jianti_auto":"楚","resolved_place_entity_id":130,"start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"8c477483-db0e-11ef-900e-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"楚","place_name_jianti_auto":"楚","resolved_place_entity_id":130,"start_index":136,"tongjian_id":"8c47748a-db0e-11ef-953a-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政","人事"],"content":"4孟嘗君聘於楚，楚王遺之象牀。登徒直送之，不欲行，謂孟嘗君門人公孫戌曰：「象牀之直千金，苟傷之毫髮，則賣妻子不足償也。足下能使僕無行者，有先人之寶劍，願獻之。」公孫戌許諾，入見孟嘗君曰：「小國所以皆致相印於君者，以君能振達貧窮，存亡繼絕，故莫不悅君之義，慕君之廉也。今始至楚而受象牀，則未至之國將何以待君哉！」孟嘗君曰：「善。」遂不受。公孫戌趨去，未至中閨，孟嘗君召而反之，曰：「子何足之高，志之揚也？」公孫戌以實對。孟嘗君乃書門版曰：「有能揚文之名，止文之過，私得寶於外者，疾入諫！」","content_fanyi":"孟尝君出使楚国，楚王送给他一张象牙床。登徒直负责送这张象牙床，不愿动身，对孟尝君的门客公孙戌说：“象牙床价值千金，如果损伤了一毫一发，我就是卖掉妻子儿女也不够赔偿。您如果能让我免去这趟差事，我有一把祖传的宝剑，愿意献给您。”公孙戌答应了，进去见孟尝君说：“各个小国之所以都把相印交给您，是因为您能救济贫穷，使灭亡的国家复存，使断绝的后嗣得续，所以没有人不敬服您的仁义、仰慕您的廉洁。如今您刚到楚国就接受象牙床，那些还没有去到的国家将用什么来接待您呢！”孟尝君说：“说得好。”于是没有接受。公孙戌快步离去，还没走到中门，孟尝君把他叫回来，说：“您为什么走路脚抬得那么高，神色那么得意？”公孙戌把实情告诉了他。孟尝君于是在门板上写道：“有人能宣扬我田文的名声，阻止我田文的过错，即使在外私下得到别人宝物，也请赶快进来进谏！”","content_jianti_auto":"4孟尝君聘于楚，楚王遗之象床。登徒直送之，不欲行，谓孟尝君门人公孙戌曰：「象床之直千金，苟伤之毫发，则卖妻子不足偿也。足下能使仆无行者，有先人之宝剑，愿献之。」公孙戌许诺，入见孟尝君曰：「小国所以皆致相印于君者，以君能振达贫穷，存亡继绝，故莫不悦君之义，慕君之廉也。今始至楚而受象床，则未至之国将何以待君哉！」孟尝君曰：「善。」遂不受。公孙戌趋去，未至中闺，孟尝君召而反之，曰：「子何足之高，志之扬也？」公孙戌以实对。孟尝君乃书门版曰：「有能扬文之名，止文之过，私得宝于外者，疾入谏！」","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":221,"number":4,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"8c477476-db0e-11ef-80a5-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"毛氏","people_name_jianti_auto":"毛氏","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"8c477493-db0e-11ef-8eaf-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"鄭氏","people_name_jianti_auto":"郑氏","start_index":24,"tongjian_id":"8c477494-db0e-11ef-b434-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"陸璣","people_name_jianti_auto":"陆玑","start_index":79,"tongjian_id":"8c477495-db0e-11ef-a463-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"郭璞","people_name_jianti_auto":"郭璞","start_index":92,"tongjian_id":"8c477496-db0e-11ef-9ca4-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"陸德明","people_name_jianti_auto":"陆德明","start_index":100,"tongjian_id":"8c477497-db0e-11ef-a2f9-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"郭璞","people_name_jianti_auto":"郭璞","start_index":137,"tongjian_id":"8c477498-db0e-11ef-a8ad-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"江","place_name_jianti_auto":"江","start_index":105,"tongjian_id":"8c477499-db0e-11ef-b85a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"江","place_name_jianti_auto":"江","start_index":110,"tongjian_id":"8c47749a-db0e-11ef-a275-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"詩·邶·谷風之辭。毛氏傳曰：葑，須也。菲，芴也。鄭氏箋曰：此二菜，蔓菁與葍之類也，皆上下可食，然其根有美時，有惡時，采之者不可以根惡幷棄其葉。下體，謂根莖也。陸璣草木疏曰：葑，蕪菁也。郭璞曰：今菘菜。陸德明曰：江南有菘，江北有蔓菁，相似而異。爾雅曰：菲，芴；又曰：菲，息菜。郭璞曰：菲，芴，士瓜；息菜，似蕪菁，華紫赤色，可食。葍，大葉，白華，根如指，色白，可食。菲，敷尾翻。邶，蒲昧翻。芴，扶拂翻。蔓，謨官翻。葍，方六翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"诗·邶·谷风之辞。毛氏传曰：葑，须也。菲，芴也。郑氏笺曰：此二菜，蔓菁与葍之类也，皆上下可食，然其根有美时，有恶时，采之者不可以根恶幷弃其叶。下体，谓根茎也。陆玑草木疏曰：葑，芜菁也。郭璞曰：今菘菜。陆德明曰：江南有菘，江北有蔓菁，相似而异。尔雅曰：菲，芴；又曰：菲，息菜。郭璞曰：菲，芴，士瓜；息菜，似芜菁，华紫赤色，可食。葍，大叶，白华，根如指，色白，可食。菲，敷尾翻。邶，蒲昧翻。芴，扶拂翻。蔓，谟官翻。葍，方六翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":59,"tongjian_id":"8c477492-db0e-11ef-a8ab-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":1019,"link_death_year":1086,"link_td_description":"司马光，字君实，号迂叟，通称司马相公，陕州夏县涑水乡（今山西省夏县）人，出生于光州光山（今河南省信阳市光山县），北宋政治家、文学家、史学家。世称涑水先生，因身后追封温国公，又称司马温公。历仕仁宗、英宗、神宗、哲宗四朝，主持编纂了中国历史上第一部编年体通史《资治通鉴》。","link_td_id":"Q10000074","link_td_number_id":6432,"people_name":"光","people_name_jianti_auto":"光","people_xingming":"司马光","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"8c4774a0-db0e-11ef-a9a2-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":-279,"link_td_description":"孟尝君，妫姓，田氏，名文，字孟，战国四公子之一，齐国的公族。其父靖郭君田婴死后，田文继位薛公于薛城（今山东滕州东南），号孟尝君，以广招宾客、食客三千闻名。","link_td_id":"Q10001044","link_td_number_id":205703,"people_name":"孟嘗君","people_name_jianti_auto":"孟尝君","people_xingming":"孟尝君","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"8c4774a1-db0e-11ef-952b-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":-279,"link_td_description":"孟尝君，妫姓，田氏，名文，字孟，战国四公子之一，齐国的公族。其父靖郭君田婴死后，田文继位薛公于薛城（今山东滕州东南），号孟尝君，以广招宾客、食客三千闻名。","link_td_id":"Q10001044","link_td_number_id":205703,"people_name":"孟嘗君","people_name_jianti_auto":"孟尝君","people_xingming":"孟尝君","start_index":59,"tongjian_id":"8c4774a3-db0e-11ef-8eb1-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["史论"],"content":"臣光曰：孟嘗君可謂能用諫矣。苟其言之善也，雖懷詐諼之心，猶將用之，況盡忠無私以事其上乎！詩云：「采葑采菲，無以下體。」孟嘗君有焉。","content_fanyi":"臣司马光说：孟尝君可以称得上是善于采纳谏言的人了。如果别人的话确有道理，即使说话人怀有欺诈之心，他尚且会采用，更何况是尽忠无私、事奉君上的人呢！《诗经》说：“采摘葑菜、菲菜，不要因为根部不好而连茎叶也丢掉。”孟尝君就有这种品德。","content_jianti_auto":"臣光曰：孟尝君可谓能用谏矣。苟其言之善也，虽怀诈谖之心，犹将用之，况尽忠无私以事其上乎！诗云：「采葑采菲，无以下体。」孟尝君有焉。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":222,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"8c477490-db0e-11ef-b6ad-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"智氏","people_name_jianti_auto":"智氏","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"8c49c1e5-db0e-11ef-81ec-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"范氏","people_name_jianti_auto":"范氏","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"8c49c1e6-db0e-11ef-8e2e-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"中行氏","people_name_jianti_auto":"中行氏","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"8c49c1e7-db0e-11ef-a0a7-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"趙氏","people_name_jianti_auto":"赵氏","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"8c49c1e8-db0e-11ef-b43f-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"韓氏","people_name_jianti_auto":"韩氏","start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"8c49c1e9-db0e-11ef-a594-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"魏氏","people_name_jianti_auto":"魏氏","start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"8c49c1ea-db0e-11ef-9577-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"晉文","people_name_jianti_auto":"晋文","start_index":25,"tongjian_id":"8c49c1eb-db0e-11ef-8178-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"襄","people_name_jianti_auto":"襄","start_index":28,"tongjian_id":"8c49c1ec-db0e-11ef-b5b5-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"齊簡公","people_name_jianti_auto":"齐简公","start_index":47,"tongjian_id":"8c49c1ed-db0e-11ef-b19d-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"闞止","people_name_jianti_auto":"阚止","start_index":51,"tongjian_id":"8c49c1ee-db0e-11ef-8789-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"陳成子","people_name_jianti_auto":"陈成子","start_index":56,"tongjian_id":"8c49c1ef-db0e-11ef-a834-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"陳常","people_name_jianti_auto":"陈常","start_index":64,"tongjian_id":"8c49c1f0-db0e-11ef-b946-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"闞止","people_name_jianti_auto":"阚止","start_index":67,"tongjian_id":"8c49c1f1-db0e-11ef-bd40-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"簡公","people_name_jianti_auto":"简公","start_index":71,"tongjian_id":"8c49c1f2-db0e-11ef-9419-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"闞","people_name_jianti_auto":"阚","start_index":74,"tongjian_id":"8c49c1f3-db0e-11ef-a8f8-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"蘇代","people_name_jianti_auto":"苏代","start_index":81,"tongjian_id":"8c49c1f4-db0e-11ef-bf3c-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"犀首","people_name_jianti_auto":"犀首","start_index":87,"tongjian_id":"8c49c1f5-db0e-11ef-95ad-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"張儀","people_name_jianti_auto":"张仪","start_index":98,"tongjian_id":"8c49c1f6-db0e-11ef-afcc-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"晉","place_name_jianti_auto":"晋","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8c49c1f7-db0e-11ef-948a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"晉國","place_name_jianti_auto":"晋国","start_index":44,"tongjian_id":"8c49c1f8-db0e-11ef-af14-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"魏","place_name_jianti_auto":"魏","start_index":85,"tongjian_id":"8c49c1f9-db0e-11ef-a731-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"韓","place_name_jianti_auto":"韩","start_index":92,"tongjian_id":"8c49c1fa-db0e-11ef-a49e-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"魏","place_name_jianti_auto":"魏","start_index":95,"tongjian_id":"8c49c1fb-db0e-11ef-95da-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"秦","place_name_jianti_auto":"秦","start_index":103,"tongjian_id":"8c49c1fc-db0e-11ef-bea4-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"魏","place_name_jianti_auto":"魏","start_index":126,"tongjian_id":"8c49c1fd-db0e-11ef-a7c6-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"晉六卿，智氏、范氏、中行氏、趙氏、韓氏、魏氏也。自晉文、襄以來，迭秉國政，後皆強大，卒分晉國。齊簡公使闞止爲政，陳成子憚之；已而陳常殺闞止，弒簡公。闞，以邑爲氏。蘇代曰：魏相犀首，必右韓而左魏；相張儀，必右秦而左魏。蓋二相外各倚與國以爲重而內爭權，所以魏日削也。闞，戶監翻。行，戶剛翻。恆，戶登翻。卒，子恤翻。相，息亮翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"晋六卿，智氏、范氏、中行氏、赵氏、韩氏、魏氏也。自晋文、襄以来，迭秉国政，后皆强大，卒分晋国。齐简公使阚止为政，陈成子惮之；已而陈常杀阚止，弑简公。阚，以邑为氏。苏代曰：魏相犀首，必右韩而左魏；相张仪，必右秦而左魏。盖二相外各倚与国以为重而内争权，所以魏日削也。阚，户监翻。行，户刚翻。恒，户登翻。卒，子恤翻。相，息亮翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":64,"tongjian_id":"8c4774a6-db0e-11ef-9826-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_death_year":-312,"link_td_description":"韩宣惠王，或称韩威侯，名康，战国时期韩国君主，韩釐侯之子，在位21年。","link_td_id":"Q10000620","link_td_number_id":334590,"people_name":"韓宣惠王","people_name_jianti_auto":"韩宣惠王","people_xingming":"韩宣惠王","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"8c49c1fe-db0e-11ef-b34c-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_td_description":"韩侈，中国战国时期韩国人。","link_td_id":"Q10003428","link_td_number_id":3358386,"people_name":"公仲","people_name_jianti_auto":"公仲","people_xingming":"公仲","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"8c49c1ff-db0e-11ef-b7e1-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_td_description":"公叔伯婴（所谓韩公叔者，公叔伯婴也，缘又有相曰公叔，故加韩以别之）。公叔伯婴不是太子婴（韩婴，字伯婴）。","link_td_id":"Q10025193","people_name":"公叔","people_name_jianti_auto":"公叔","people_xingming":"公叔","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"8c49c200-db0e-11ef-9da0-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_td_description":"缪留，《战国策》作摎留，战国时期韩国人物。","link_td_id":"Q10023380","link_td_number_id":8301843,"people_name":"繆留","people_name_jianti_auto":"缪留","people_xingming":"缪留","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"8c49c201-db0e-11ef-a791-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":-481,"link_td_description":"齐简公，姜姓，名壬，齐悼公之子。","link_td_id":"Q10001704","link_td_number_id":330156,"people_name":"齊簡公","people_name_jianti_auto":"齐简公","people_xingming":"姜壬","start_index":36,"tongjian_id":"8c49c202-db0e-11ef-928c-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[姜壬]"},{"link_td_description":"田恒，妫姓，田氏，名恒，原为陈恒，古音田、陈音近，也称为田恒。东周春秋战国时期齐国的权臣。是齐国田氏家族的第八任首领。","link_td_id":"Q10001998","link_td_number_id":1008974,"people_name":"陳成子","people_name_jianti_auto":"陈成子","people_xingming":"田恒","start_index":40,"tongjian_id":"8c49c203-db0e-11ef-ac4d-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[田恒]"},{"link_death_year":-481,"link_td_description":"阚止，《史记》作监止，字子我，东周春秋时期齐国的大夫。","link_td_id":"Q10003106","link_td_number_id":1683562,"people_name":"闞止","people_name_jianti_auto":"阚止","people_xingming":"阚止","start_index":44,"tongjian_id":"8c49c204-db0e-11ef-ab84-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":-360,"link_death_year":-300,"link_td_description":"公孙衍，魏国阴晋（今华阴市东北）人，战国时期出身于魏国的纵横家，先后于秦国、魏国为官，为张仪的连横策略的主要对手。","link_td_id":"Q10009429","link_td_number_id":670335,"people_name":"犀首","people_name_jianti_auto":"犀首","people_xingming":"公孙衍","start_index":52,"tongjian_id":"8c49c205-db0e-11ef-bdf5-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[公孙衍]"},{"link_birth_year":-373,"link_death_year":-310,"link_td_description":"张仪，姬姓，张氏，魏国安邑（今山西夏县）人，战国时期著名的纵横家。提倡连横，即秦国联合其他诸侯国中的几个，然后对抗其他的诸侯国，多次破坏了公孙衍的合纵，为秦惠王重用，封武信君，卒于魏国。","link_td_id":"Q10002172","link_td_number_id":133753,"people_name":"張儀","people_name_jianti_auto":"张仪","people_xingming":"张仪","start_index":55,"tongjian_id":"8c49c206-db0e-11ef-9396-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"晉","place_name_jianti_auto":"晋","resolved_place_entity_id":110,"start_index":28,"tongjian_id":"8c49c207-db0e-11ef-aa79-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"魏","place_name_jianti_auto":"魏","resolved_place_entity_id":1,"start_index":50,"tongjian_id":"8c49c208-db0e-11ef-bfc0-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"西河","place_name_jianti_auto":"西河","resolved_place_entity_id":562,"start_index":58,"tongjian_id":"8c49c209-db0e-11ef-9438-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/〇、封域山川险要（卷五十二）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"[吕氏曰：秦孝公用商鞅，取河西地。其尽得河西，则犀首张仪...","context_before":"...年，魏纳上郡十五县[今延安以北地]，而河西之地尽入于秦。","source_end_index":425,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"8e5a0768-dfec-539f-9b20-8e795d4ab86a","source_start_index":396,"source_text":"《战国策》：摎留谓韩王，魏两用犀首张仪，而西河之外亡。是也"}],"path":"陕西方舆纪要/〇、封域山川险要（卷五十二）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":["内政","权争"],"content":"5韓宣惠王欲兩用公仲、公叔爲政，問於繆留。對曰：「不可，晉用六卿而國分；齊簡公用陳成子及闞止而見殺；魏用犀首、張儀而西河之外亡。今君兩用之，其多力者內樹黨，其寡力者藉外權。羣臣有內樹黨以驕主，有外爲交以削地，君之國危矣。」","content_fanyi":"韩宣惠王想同时任用公仲和公叔两人执掌国政，便向缪留询问。缪留回答说：“不可以，晋国任用六卿，国家因而分裂；齐简公任用陈成子和阚止，自身因而被杀；魏国任用犀首、张仪，西河以外的土地因而丧失。如今您要同时任用这两人，他们中力量强的一方便会在国内树立党羽，力量弱的一方便会向外借助他国权势。群臣中有的在国内树立党羽以欺凌君主，有的对外结交以削减国土，您的国家就危险了。”","content_jianti_auto":"5韩宣惠王欲两用公仲、公叔为政，问于缪留。对曰：「不可，晋用六卿而国分；齐简公用陈成子及阚止而见杀；魏用犀首、张仪而西河之外亡。今君两用之，其多力者内树党，其寡力者藉外权。群臣有内树党以骄主，有外为交以削地，君之国危矣。」","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":223,"number":5,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"8c4774a4-db0e-11ef-a485-a0d3651f611f"}],"reign_name":"四十八年","reign_name_jianti_auto":"四十八年","start_index":39,"tongjian_id":"8c451b49-db0e-11ef-89bb-a0d3651f611f","year_anno":"（庚子、前三二一）","year_int":-321},"message":"success","success":true}